```

Of course for the screenshot, Windows would need to transform the whole desktop to one colour space (scRGB with Rec. 709 primaries), but my hope was that Windows would not do any such transformations when writing our game window to the output buffer, since it was already in Rec. 2020 10-bit ST2084 full rage RGB format.

